{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">資深藝人陳榮峻入行半世紀，憑著精湛演技將多個反派角色演得入木三分，近年在處境劇《愛·回家之開心速遞》飾演「譚道德」一角亦深入民心。回顧其演藝生涯，他在2001年吳啟華版《倚天屠龍記》中飾演城府極深、陰險毒辣的丐幫叛徒「陳友諒」，至今依然是不少劇迷心目中的童年陰影。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8f00ec0d-00ec-470e-a1f4-47fcffaba04a.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026tmtgVtvJBp1784689046.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8f00ec0d-00ec-470e-a1f4-47fcffaba04a.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">日前，陳榮峻於社交平台分享多段短片，再次換上經典古裝造型，重現當年「陳友諒」的風采。影片中，現年70歲的他保養得宜，身穿褐色配黑色古裝、束起長髮並手持長劍，神情肅穆且眼神充滿殺氣，威嚴與奸險氣場絲毫不減當年。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">陳榮峻手握劍柄指向鏡頭，咬牙切齒地演繹多句經典對白：「你哋明教其他分舵位於何處？」「你哋教主而家身在何處？」「你再唔講就冇機會講！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0060fd2c-7d41-4f44-aa34-ce92055137de.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20266GaKFJcLst1784689039.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0060fd2c-7d41-4f44-aa34-ce92055137de.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">這段影片將角色的狠辣性格表現得淋漓盡致，瞬間喚起大批網民與武俠劇迷的集體回憶。網民紛紛留言大讚他寶刀未老、演技出神入化：「當年睇《倚天》真係覺得佢奸到入骨」、「演技依舊咁犀利」、「不愧是老戲骨！」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-26T01:15:10.652239+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":403,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}